OL,3,GNEWSAFrom young offender to junior
OL,4,Adoctor: 'I wrote a plan and stuck to
OL,5,Ait'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSteven Beattie spent his teenage years
OL,8,Fin and out of Polmont young offenders'
OL,9,Finstitution, once described by a former
OL,10,Fgovernor as "the most violent prison in
OL,11,FScotland".
OL,13,FHe was sent there at 16 after drunkenly
OL,14,Fcrashing a stolen car, and returned
OL,15,Frepeatedly over the next four years as
OL,16,Fhis involvement with gangs and violence
OL,17,Fgrew.
OL,19,FFor Steven, the turning point came when
OL,20,Fhe was punished for his part in a fight
OL,21,Fby being locked up for 23 hours a day
OL,22,Fand having his TV removed.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
