OL,3,GNEWSAFrom young offender to junior
OL,4,Adoctor: 'I wrote a plan and stuck to
OL,5,Ait'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I never really had time to sit down
OL,8,Fand think where my life was going," he
OL,9,Ftold the BBC's Scotcast podcast.
